        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Pinna with mild erythema and fine scale of the conchal bowl and postauricular skin; mild tenderness of the pinna and tragus. No swelling, cellulitis, or fluctuance. External auditory canal with mild erythema and scant dry scale; no oedema, debris, pus, moist crust, or odour."
